OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FBerlioz's Symphonie Fantastique
OL,7,     Ffrom the Royal Liverpool
OL,8,     FPhilharmonic Orchestra, baritone
OL,9,     FAndrew Hamilton sings Schumann's
OL,10,     FLiederkreis and the Chaos Quartet
OL,11,     Fplays Errollyn Wallen.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Anonymous
OL,13,     F5/5. Donald Macleod examines the
OL,14,     Fidea that Anonymous music can
OL,15,     Frepresent something preserved
OL,16,     Frather than someone forgotten.
OL,17,     FWith guest contributors Fay Hield
OL,18,     Fand Lisa Colton.
