OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FGuitarist Xuefei Yang performs
OL,7,     Flive. Composer Ola Gjeilo is also
OL,8,     Fin 80A to discuss his new album
OL,9,     F'Ordinary Moments', out today.
OL,10,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,11,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Fsoundscape of classical music.
OL,13,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     FThe BBC National Orchestra of
OL,15,     FWales and Kevin John Edusei
OL,16,     Fperform John Adams, a Tansy Davies
OL,17,     Fworld premiere with percussionist
OL,18,     FColin Currie, and Shostakovich's
OL,19,     F10th Symphony.
